                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "650bba0b-6340-3af8-9894-cf27e2097209",
                        "entry_id": "ef4e1ba6-2fdd-398c-b152-672ae6e1cde5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "обработка дерева, древесины"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34a4acee-d0f1-40b4-9a45-72ffd0096155",
                                "sense_id": "650bba0b-6340-3af8-9894-cf27e2097209",
                                "text": "Детей учили рисованию, технологии деревообработки и резьбы по дереву."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6644ad37-3585-3025-b1a1-21f4efe09e45",
                        "entry_id": "ef4e1ba6-2fdd-398c-b152-672ae6e1cde5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "экон. отрасль экономики по обработке дерева"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e1b6ab8-b204-4ac0-aa2e-5f1d7e4eeff9",
                                "sense_id": "6644ad37-3585-3025-b1a1-21f4efe09e45",
                                "text": "Предполагается, что строительство панельно-каркасных домов будет вестись с использованием отечественных материалов: дерева (брус и погонаж) и отходов деревообработки ― стружки, опилок, продуктов дробления несортовой древесины, которые применяются при изготовлении плитного облицовочного материала и утеплителей."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ada0c92-2212-40db-9205-f89fcabec348",
                                "sense_id": "6644ad37-3585-3025-b1a1-21f4efe09e45",
                                "text": "Это прежде всего крупные лесные корпорации с вертикально интегрированными структурами (ВИС), образовавшиеся на базе кооперации целлюлозно-бумажных комбинатов (ЦБК), заводов древесностружечных плит (ДСП), лесопиления и деревообработки, а также находящихся в сфере влияния корпораций лесозаготовительных предприятий, обеспечивающих их древесным сырьём."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fa7d171-674b-4f88-b431-7427579ad28b",
                                "sense_id": "6644ad37-3585-3025-b1a1-21f4efe09e45",
                                "text": "Среди других посетителям выставки-ярмарки предложат свою продукцию фирмы: «Альтэко» (продажа и установка окон ПВХ TROCAL), «Полирус» (реализация лакокрасочных материалов), ООО «Стройдеталь-2002» (реализация цементно-стружечных плит), ООО «Экойл-лес» из Богородского района (деревообработка и реализация пиломатериала ― брус, евровагонка, европол, погонаж), ООО «Саддекор-НН» (проектирование и реализация товаров для ландшафт-дизайна), ООО «Грань-НН»…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e1fb725-ae79-3052-bf61-8172dddcb61e",
                        "entry_id": "ef4e1ba6-2fdd-398c-b152-672ae6e1cde5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предприятие или производственный участок по обработке дерева"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de209b83-c47f-4ec5-91a1-ec4a1a05830e",
                                "sense_id": "9e1fb725-ae79-3052-bf61-8172dddcb61e",
                                "text": "Своя деревообработка у нас появилась совсем недавно, а на лечебном корпусе все деревянные конструкции были установлены ещё в прошлом году."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85adc3ee-6f4e-407b-8347-11ba9a669c6a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef4e1ba6-2fdd-398c-b152-672ae6e1cde5",
                        "target_lang_word": "woodworking",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "woodworking",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfb7de4c-84ef-3675-b5e2-1c05098f9428",
                                        "entry_id": "ed224651-cb71-31cd-9d8c-759d90cc6875",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The crafts of carpentry, cabinet making and related skills of making things from wood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d90b372-a692-4910-bd30-cd7418db7cfd",
                                                "sense_id": "dfb7de4c-84ef-3675-b5e2-1c05098f9428",
                                                "text": "There are two woodworkings, the first being the idealized one, the woodworking of expectations, where everything turns out perfect. The spouse is pleased, each and every joint is of Krenovian perfection […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b36bcba2-1b5d-4926-9c8b-610185ebc881",
                                                "sense_id": "dfb7de4c-84ef-3675-b5e2-1c05098f9428",
                                                "text": "MDF and HDF – or medium-density fiberboard and high-density fiberboard – are two of the trendiest materials in woodworking these days."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "woodworking",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0bf25b9-c394-3249-aec0-b6f31b300797",
                                        "entry_id": "3cc3c22d-a216-3e99-82c4-5c5a79e17561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of woodwork"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5a879899-2077-4a10-8b21-f8d046519aa1",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef4e1ba6-2fdd-398c-b152-672ae6e1cde5",
                        "target_lang_word": "woodwork",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "woodwork",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "320b7728-0b57-3184-b103-d91b3be944c4",
                                        "entry_id": "9963ed83-2f57-34c1-a604-8d90a991ae26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something made from wood, especially cabinets and trim (e.g., baseboards, doorframes) made from millwork."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39520177-5471-4638-a8c9-7a73917aa80a",
                                                "sense_id": "320b7728-0b57-3184-b103-d91b3be944c4",
                                                "text": "Some woodwork and the plaster ceiling medallions have been duplicated to match the originals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72ef6931-2b95-36f3-b690-f0c761071088",
                                        "entry_id": "9963ed83-2f57-34c1-a604-8d90a991ae26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Working with wood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "928eb4d6-95c4-42dc-9e1c-7d547c969cca",
                                                "sense_id": "72ef6931-2b95-36f3-b690-f0c761071088",
                                                "text": "He does woodwork as a hobby."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6d144ac-71d5-47ed-b05b-c5403817f6f2",
                                                "sense_id": "72ef6931-2b95-36f3-b690-f0c761071088",
                                                "text": "The unthinking man assumes that if woodwork is to be taught, the best person to do it must be a carpenter"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ee70ab2-4226-3e3a-b07d-0f53a2b9a99c",
                                        "entry_id": "9963ed83-2f57-34c1-a604-8d90a991ae26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place of concealment or obscurity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be699631-9110-4224-a4a8-b1a4c9274f25",
                                                "sense_id": "9ee70ab2-4226-3e3a-b07d-0f53a2b9a99c",
                                                "text": "out of the woodwork"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18a80e08-c8e0-45cf-8dc5-5776743d78aa",
                                                "sense_id": "9ee70ab2-4226-3e3a-b07d-0f53a2b9a99c",
                                                "text": "Friends and relatives were coming out of the woodwork to celebrate his good fortune."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05074270-494e-4f30-a6f3-2db99407ef37",
                                                "sense_id": "9ee70ab2-4226-3e3a-b07d-0f53a2b9a99c",
                                                "text": "So when he wants to, he can just kind of blend into the woodwork."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86fa563a-2661-30bb-a000-047265024f6a",
                                        "entry_id": "9963ed83-2f57-34c1-a604-8d90a991ae26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The frame of the goal, i.e. the goalpost or crossbar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd295dd2-ddaf-4f7d-846d-2b6ef460df5a",
                                                "sense_id": "86fa563a-2661-30bb-a000-047265024f6a",
                                                "text": "That goal was so close, it went in off the woodwork."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7dc391f-0a09-4984-af22-08379ae314a6",
                                                "sense_id": "86fa563a-2661-30bb-a000-047265024f6a",
                                                "text": "Carroll thought he had equalised with his header against the bar with eight minutes left. Liverpool claimed the ball had cross the line and Chelsea were grateful for a miraculous intervention from Cech to turn his effort on to the woodwork."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "woodwork",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dec1855b-2232-376b-b4bb-90c2e622ef27",
                                        "entry_id": "1d39088e-c9ef-321b-8fb1-5c5d6a206f32",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To go completely stealth as a transgender person. (From the idea of fading or blending into the woodwork.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df0edb02-bba8-4c29-8870-edf92a5d3082",
                                                "sense_id": "dec1855b-2232-376b-b4bb-90c2e622ef27",
                                                "text": "\"Instead of 'woodworking,' or disappearing into the mainstream — as we are capable of and qualified to do — we have chosen not to do so.\" Outside of the transsexual community, other changes were taking place that made it possible for[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f967511f-f109-4171-9a28-1c08c6ebe18e",
                                                "sense_id": "dec1855b-2232-376b-b4bb-90c2e622ef27",
                                                "text": "Maybe — and this was essential for political activism — you didn't have to \"woodwork\" but could be transgendered for all to see. By the mid '90s the Internet had arrived — and spread these new ideas like wildfire.[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
